WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.649
You’ve done the hard part:

2
00:00:01.649 --> 00:00:03.564
identifying the skills and experiences

3
00:00:03.564 --> 00:00:05.457
you can actually prove.

4
00:00:05.457 --> 00:00:08.045
When this District is complete, Level Up can

5
00:00:08.045 --> 00:00:10.286
help you put that evidence to work.

6
00:00:10.286 --> 00:00:12.097
Your résumé builder can help you start a

7
00:00:12.097 --> 00:00:15.255
résumé, improve the one you already have, or

8
00:00:15.255 --> 00:00:17.589
tailor it toward a different job.

9
00:00:17.589 --> 00:00:20.038
Nova can help turn your real experiences

10
00:00:20.038 --> 00:00:22.836
into clear résumé language while keeping you

11
00:00:22.836 --> 00:00:25.065
in control of what gets included.

12
00:00:25.065 --> 00:00:28.746
For now, choose the next step that would help you most.

13
00:00:28.746 --> 00:00:30.475
We’ll make that option available when

14
00:00:30.475 --> 00:00:32.461
you finish your reflection activity.
